 "offset_seconds": -3.0200000000001914,
 "words_heard": 185,
 "words": 188,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They baked the bricks and they burned them hard",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They mixed the tar in the city yard",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "One people with one language, one dream in every eye",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We'll build ourselves a tower that will scrape against the sky",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come, let us build ourselves a city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With a tower that reaches to the heavens",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And make a name for ourselves",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make a name, make a name for ourselves",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Higher went the scaffolding, higher went the pride",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing we set our minds to could be denied",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD came down to see the city and the tower",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That the children of man were building in their hour",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come, let us build ourselves a city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With a tower that reaches to the heavens",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And make a name for ourselves",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make a name, make a name for ourselves",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the words began to tangle and the voices turned to noise",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The foreman couldn't call them and the builders lost their poise",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the LORD scattered them from there over the face of the whole earth",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they stopped building the city",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A name for ourselves",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It was never ours to make",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  }
